https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=2c76807b8c5782751f92e7169c7b87141130a0b7&url=https%3A%2F%2Fbetterstack.com%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page

Hey Tejas,

When something breaks, you want to fix it, not answer the same support ticket
fifty times.

A status page does the talking for you. It updates automatically from your
monitors, so your users know what’s going on while you work on it.

Create your status page →
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=28b60e2302d2e56a36b545bd408d2887b29d2295&url=https%3A%2F%2Fincidents.betterstack.com%2Fteam%2F0%2Fstatus-pages%2Fnew%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page]
3 minutes

Create your status page
[https://betterstack.com/static/images/email/onboarding/status-pages.png]
https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=28b60e2302d2e56a36b545bd408d2887b29d2295&url=https%3A%2F%2Fincidents.betterstack.com%2Fteam%2F0%2Fstatus-pages%2Fnew%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page


HOW DOES IT WORK?

If you have users, you need a status page. It’s the first place they look when
something feels off. That’s why pages like status.huggingface.co
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=749b2bfcb244b1fc8a3e1f7cab758b97d4df1c1d&url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatus.huggingface.co%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page]
or githubstatus.com
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=7374f3290465aeea3b95715c99fa93271a1e232b&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.githubstatus.com%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page]
exist.

Pick the monitors you want to show, add your logo and put it on
status.yourdomain.com. Your users can subscribe to updates by email, Slack or
RSS.

Your first status page is free with Better Stack.

Watch a demo
[https://betterstack.com/static/images/email/onboarding/demos/why-have-a-status-page.png]
https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=af13692bcd340a5b347c37db5231144ce3a1affd&url=https%3A%2F%2Fbetterstack.com%2Fdemos%2Fstatus-page%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page


FIRST TIME SETTING THIS UP?

Watch a demo
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=af13692bcd340a5b347c37db5231144ce3a1affd&url=https%3A%2F%2Fbetterstack.com%2Fdemos%2Fstatus-page%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page],
see a live example
[https://betterstack.com/ahoy/messages/cAEN0UuR4xbxOWlGm0qYpTg3aYjyPanu/click?signature=a31a94d7ee0d234f595ad5517d7f745682462ba4&url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatus.betterstack.com%2F%3Futm_source%3Dintro%252Fonboarding_drip_journey%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_campaign%3Dreliability_status_page],
or reply to this email. We’re always happy to help.

Speak soon,

